~ start
do locals.tumor_puzzle = CharacterData.Hugo.tumor_puzzle.instantiate()
do PuzzleManager.add_puzzle_to_scene(locals.tumor_puzzle)
do locals.tumor_puzzle.setup_round()
$> locals.wanted_tumors = locals.tumor_puzzle.get_wanted_tumor_textures_path()
Hugo: Quero que você escolha três das minhas perebas mais lindas!
Hugo: Por favor, encontre para mim:
Hugo: [img=80]{{locals.wanted_tumors[0]}}[/img] [img=80]{{locals.wanted_tumors[1]}}[/img] [img=80]{{locals.wanted_tumors[2]}}[/img]
- -Iniciar- => start_puzzle
- Sair => END!
=> END

~ start_puzzle
Hugo: Vamos lá!
do locals.tumor_puzzle.start()
=> END